enge waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These game modes also serve as testing grounds for shaping the future of Deck Dash. Let us know which modes pique your interest so we can refine the core game with your feedback in mind.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Featured Decks</strong> – Try out curated decks with unique synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All-in Brawl</strong> – High-risk, high-reward battles with everything on the line.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harsh Survival</strong> – Endurance-based matches that test your adaptability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Proving Grounds</strong> – A true test of skill for seasoned strategists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829750/extras/8222527ceb0587b863a00d13fb30691b.poster.avif?t=1760572730\" width=608 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829750/extras/8222527ceb0587b863a00d13fb30691b.webm?t=1760572730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829750/extras/8222527ceb0587b863a00d13fb30691b.mp4?t=1760572730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
